---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: page-inner page-pricing
permalink: /pricing/
title: "Pricing | Digital Marketing Packages Melbourne | Candor Digital"
description: "Clear pricing for social media management, Meta ads, email marketing and websites in Melbourne. Month-to-month, ad spend never marked up, free 30-minute audit before any quote."
tag: "the number, up front"
heading: "Simple pricing, <em>no lock-in</em>."
lede: "Most agencies hide their prices behind a sales call. Here are ours. Start with a one-off trial, then go month to month. Your exact quote follows a free 30-minute audit, so you only pay for what makes sense."
secondaryCta: { label: "See services", url: "/services/" }
breadcrumbs: [{ name: "Pricing", url: "/pricing/" }]
faqHeading: "Pricing questions"
faqs:
  - { q: "Why 'from' prices instead of one fixed number?", a: "Because the work differs. One platform with light content costs less than three platforms with weekly video. The 'from' price is the honest starting point; the free audit tells us what you need, and your quote is fixed in writing before we start." }
  - { q: "What does the $450 trial include?", a: "Four weeks on one channel (social, Meta ads or email), a plan agreed before we start, and a week-4 report with a five-minute video. After that you decide: continue month to month, change direction or walk away. There's no obligation to continue." }
  - { q: "Is ad spend included?", a: "No. Your Meta or Google ad budget is charged by the platform directly to your card and never marked up. Our fee covers the work only." }
  - { q: "Are there setup fees?", a: "Ongoing services don't have setup fees. Websites and one-off builds, like email flow setup, are quoted as a fixed project price." }
  - { q: "Is there a minimum term?", a: "No. The trial is a one-off four weeks, and after that everything is month-to-month. You can pause, change or stop with notice." }
  - { q: "Do you offer discounts for longer commitments?", a: "We'd rather earn your business every month than lock you in, so we don't push long contracts. If you want a longer arrangement, ask in the audit." }
---
{% include "page-hero.njk" %}

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="price-grid">
      {% for p in pricing.packages %}
      <article id="{{ p.name | slugify }}" class="price-card reveal{% if p.featured %} is-featured{% endif %}" data-reveal>
        {% if p.featured %}<span class="price-flag">Most popular</span>{% endif %}
        <h2>{{ p.name }}</h2>
        <p class="price-amount">{{ p.price | replace("from ", "<span class=\"from\">from</span> ") | safe }} <small>{{ p.per }}</small></p>
        <p class="muted">{{ p.line }}</p>
        <ul class="check-list">{% for i in p.includes %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        <a class="btn {% if p.featured %}btn-primary{% else %}btn-secondary{% endif %} magnetic" href="/contact/" data-hover><span>Start with a free audit</span></a>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="price-note muted">{{ pricing.note }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alt-band">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">always included</span></div>
      <h2>What every plan comes with</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>A free 30-minute audit before any quote</li>
        <li>A one-page monthly report plus a five-minute video walkthrough</li>
        <li>Direct access to the person doing the work</li>
        <li>Every account, asset and file in your name</li>
        <li>Month-to-month terms, no lock-in contracts</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.08s">
      <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-spark" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-text">never included</span></div>
      <h2>What you won&rsquo;t pay for</h2>
      <ul class="cross-list">
        <li>Markup on your ad spend</li>
        <li>Setup fees on ongoing services</li>
        <li>Lock-in contracts or exit fees</li>
        <li>Reports padded with vanity metrics</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "faq-block.njk" %}
{% include "cta-band.njk" %}
